17:T4d6,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is every PKU award for new international students?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The scholarship directory includes notices with different audiences, including current students. Read the title, applicant definition and cycle before using a notice for an incoming application."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Yenching Academy the same as the general PKU Scholarship?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It is a specific programme with its own admissions and scholarship rules. Its funding must not be presented as the universal award for all PKU degrees."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use the 2026 passport requirement for 2027?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not as a verified rule. Read the new programme notice and check its actual validity requirement. An old calendar date should not be carried into a future application checklist."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are university scholarships unconditional for the full degree?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Read the individual award conditions. The official PKU Scholarship description includes annual review for renewal."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"china-page","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/peking-university-admissions-scholarships/\",\"name\":\"Peking University admissions and scholarships: choose the right funding route\",\"description\":\"Compare PKU admission, CGS, university scholarship and applicant-stage requirements with official notices and clear cycle checks.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/peking-university-admissions-scholarships/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-20\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-20\",\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@t